是鮮嫩好吃，餐後冰淇淋不會過甜，搭配得挺好的。\n雞湯桑加入會員後的優惠挺大方的，很推。\n各分店也有推出不同的特色餐點，可以看店內廣告螢幕。",null,[0,116]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9295025532956345940/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3ZEdKV1NqVmtNMnhhWWpCd1VVNHhiSGxQUmxKd1QwVk9hbFpZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9295025532956345940/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3ZEdKV1NqVmtNMnhhWWpCd1VVNHhiSGxQUmxKd1QwVk9hbFpZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/9295025532956345940/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3ZEdKV1NqVmtNMnhhWWpCd1VVNHhiSGxQUmxKd1QwVk9hbFpZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9295025532956345940/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3ZEdKV1NqVmtNMnhhWWpCd1VVNHhiSGxQUmxKd1QwVk9hbFpZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9295025532956345940/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3ZEdKV1NqVmtNMnhhWWpCd1VVNHhiSGxQUmxKd1QwVk9hbFpZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9295025532956345940/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnh3ZEdKV1NqVmtNMnhhWWpCd1VVNHhiSGxQUmxKd1QwVk9hbFpZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,17992,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwdGJWSjVkM2xaYjBwUU4xbHlPRlJwT0VOalZYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x68164e23b078ce08!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlptbVJ5d3lZb0pQN1lyOFRpOENjVXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwdGJWSjVkM2xaYjBwUU4xbHlPRlJwT0VOalZYYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwdGJWSjVkM2xaYjBwUU4xbHlPRlJwT0VOalZYYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwdGJWSjVkM2xaYjBwUU4xbHlPRlJwT0VOalZYYxILMGRSU0YwaEZHZGMaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09scHRiVko1ZDNsWmIwcFFOMWx5T0ZScE9FTmpWWGMSCzBkUlNGMGhGR2RjIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARCM54sCNOFmgqCzBkUlNGMGhGR2Rj\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d2867